# Which indexer, at which version, produced each fixture's committed index.scip.
#
# `crates/extract/tests/indexer_pin.rs` compares this against the
# `Metadata.tool_info` inside every `tests/fixtures/*/index.scip` and FAILS on a
# mismatch, on a fixture with no line here, and on a line with no fixture. A
# regenerated fixture therefore cannot change producer silently: change the line
# in the same commit, and read the diff of `expected.facts` for what moved.
# Runbook: tests/fixtures/README.md § Indexer pins.
#
# <fixture dir><TAB><tool name> <tool version>
